 r←Version
⍝ Returns the version number from `TatinVars.CONFIG`, looked for first in this namespace, then in its parent.
⍝ See also `History`
 :If 0<⎕NC'TatinVars.CONFIG'
     r←(⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')⊢TatinVars.CONFIG).version
 :ElseIf 0<##.⎕NC'TatinVars.CONFIG'
     r←(⎕JSON⍠('Dialect' 'JSON5')⊢##.TatinVars.CONFIG).version
 :Else
⍝ When the code was loaded by neither Tatin nor Cider, there is no namespace `TatinVars`.
⍝ In such cases we cannot provide a version number, so we return just ''.
     r←''
 :EndIf
